<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Styled Page</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header id="header">
    <h1>Welcome to My Styled Page</h1>
  </header>

  <section class="content">
    <h2>Introduction</h2>
    <p>This page demonstrates the use of CSS selectors and various styling properties.</p>
    <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/300" alt="Placeholder Image" class="image">
  </section>

  <footer class="footer">
    <p>&copy; 2025 My Website</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>

/* Selector 1: ID Selector for Header */
#header {
  background-color: #4CAF50;
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

/* Selector 2: Class Selector for Content Section */
.content {
  font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
  background-color: #f4f4f4;
  padding: 30px;
  margin: 0 20px;
  border: 2px solid #ddd;
}

/* Selector 3: Class Selector for Footer */
.footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 10px;
  background-color: #333;
  color: white;
  margin-top: 20px;
}

/* Style for Image */
.image {
  display: block;
  margin: 0 auto 20px;
  border: 5px solid #ddd;
  padding: 10px;
}
